<view class="page zip-page care-page"><view class="zip-top"><view><view class="zip-title">AI 护理计划</view><view class="zip-sub">基于你的化妆台 · 个性化生成专属护理流程</view></view></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="zip-tabs care-tabs"><text wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="*this" class="zip-tab {{active===item?'active':''}}" data-v="{{item}}" bindtap="select">{{item}}</text></scroll-view><view class="source-card soft-card"><image src="/assets/zip/vanity_hero_showcase_1792080326105.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view><text>只使用我的化妆台</text><text class="small">基于你已有的产品，生成可执行的护理计划</text></view><switch checked="{{onlyVanity}}" bindchange="toggle" color="#e25c70"/></view><view class="time-grid"><view class="time-item {{time==='3分钟'?'selected':''}}" data-v="3分钟" bindtap="chooseTime"><text class="strong">3分钟</text><text class="small">快速高效</text></view><view class="time-item {{time==='5分钟'?'selected':''}}" data-v="5分钟" bindtap="chooseTime"><text class="strong">5分钟</text><text class="small">平衡护理</text></view><view class="time-item {{time==='完整护理'?'selected':''}}" data-v="完整护理" bindtap="chooseTime"><text class="strong">完整护理</text><text class="small">全套精致呵护</text></view></view><view class="routine-block soft-card"><view class="routine-title">晨间护理 <text class="small">约 {{time}}</text></view><view wx:for="{{steps}}" wx:key="step_number" class="care-step"><text class="step-num">{{index+1}}</text><image src="/assets/zip/skincare_routine_calm_1792080328109.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view><text class="strong">{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.product_name}}</text><text class="small">{{item.dosage}} · {{item.wait_time}}</text></view></view></view><view class="routine-block evening soft-card"><view class="routine-title">晚间护理 <text class="small">深层清洁 · 修护滋养</text></view><view wx:for="{{steps}}" wx:key="step_number" class="care-step"><text class="step-num pink">{{index+1}}</text><image src="/assets/zip/skincare_routine_calm_1792080328109.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view><text class="strong">{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.product_name}}</text><text class="small">{{item.dosage}} · {{item.wait_time}}</text></view></view></view><button class="zip-primary wide" bindtap="generate">{{loading?'生成中…':'生成护理计划'}}</button><button class="zip-secondary" bindtap="check">记录今日护肤感受</button><bottom-nav active-key="care"/></view>